request leave v1 "Leave, for those who may ask"
description "Leave only some may ask for (fictional rules): `submitted by`, a request made in somebody's name, and a ticket made again after the organization changed"

use organization org from "../../examples/shared/company.ringi"
use calendar office from "../../examples/shared/office.cal"

form
  days : number "Business days"  range >=1 <=20

route
  manager  manager

who
  manager = manager of requester

every stage
  due in 2 business days at end of day
  when late escalate, then expire
  when empty escalate, then skip

ticket
  # (fictional) the members of Sales Department 1 itself and of the board do not ask
  submitted by   everyone except team sales1, team board
  self approval  not allowed
  send back      to the requester, at most 2 times
  resubmit       within 5 business days

# made by a proxy in the requester's name, sent back, and made again by the proxy
scenario a_proxy_asks_for_someone
  requester e1203
  form days = 3
| at               | event     | by    | -> stage | status         |
| 2026-12-01 10:00 | submit    | e1201 | manager  | in progress    |
| 2026-12-01 11:00 | send back | e1101 |          | with requester |
| 2026-12-02 10:00 | resubmit  | e1201 | manager  | in progress    |
| 2026-12-02 11:00 | approve   | e1101 |          | approved       |

# the section is gone from the next version, and its members are members of the department, who
# may not ask: a ticket made before is made again all the same, and its manager is the one the
# new version gives
scenario made_again_after_the_organization_changed
  requester e1201
  form days = 3
| at               | event     | by    | -> stage | status         |
| 2027-03-31 10:00 | submit    | e1201 | manager  | in progress    |
| 2027-03-31 11:00 | send back | e1101 |          | with requester |
| 2027-04-01 10:00 | resubmit  | e1201 | manager  | in progress    |
| 2027-04-01 11:00 | approve   | e3101 |          | approved       |
